@page "/overview"

<PageTitle>Solution Overview | Base Template</PageTitle>

<section class="overview-page">
    <div class="overview-hero">
        <span class="eyebrow">Solution overview</span>
        <h1>Modern enterprise base template.</h1>
        <p>
            This foundation demonstrates a modular monolith architecture with bounded contexts, production-grade security,
            scalable UI components, and integrated third-party capabilities like Payments and Identity Management.
        </p>
    </div>

    <MudGrid Spacing="4">
        <!-- Architecture -->
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
            <MudPaper Class="overview-card" Elevation="0">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.AccountTree" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-3" />
                <h2>Modular Architecture</h2>
                <p>Domain-Driven Design boundaries across IAM, Billing, HR, and Shared modules. Clear separation of application logic, persistence, and external adapters.</p>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>

        <!-- UI & UX -->
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
            <MudPaper Class="overview-card" Elevation="0">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Web" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-3" />
                <h2>Responsive UI</h2>
                <p>Blazor Web App paired with MudBlazor. Features glassmorphism aesthetics, dynamic data tables, complex forms, and robust state management.</p>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>

        <!-- Identity & Security -->
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
            <MudPaper Class="overview-card" Elevation="0">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Security" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-3" />
                <h2>Identity & Security</h2>
                <p>Complete IAM engine with ASP.NET Core Identity. Role-based access control, granular permission claims, MFA, and trusted device tracking.</p>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>

        <!-- Billing & Payments -->
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
            <MudPaper Class="overview-card" Elevation="0">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Payments" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-3" />
                <h2>Payments (Stripe & M-Pesa)</h2>
                <p>Pre-configured integrations with Stripe and M-Pesa. Support for subscriptions, payment intents, and local mobile money flows (East Africa).</p>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>

        <!-- Persistence -->
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
            <MudPaper Class="overview-card" Elevation="0">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Storage" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-3" />
                <h2>Persistence & Caching</h2>
                <p>EF Core with context-specific DbSets, tenant isolation, automatic soft-delete, and audit tracking. Redis integration for distributed caching.</p>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>

        <!-- Operations -->
        <MudItem xs="12" md="6" lg="4">
            <MudPaper Class="overview-card" Elevation="0">
                <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.MonitorHeart" Size="Size.Large" Class="mb-3" />
                <h2>Observability & Ops</h2>
                <p>Health checks, structured Serilog logging (Seq ready), OpenAPI/Scalar documentation, Dockerized local dev, and Azure-ready deployments.</p>
            </MudPaper>
        </MudItem>
    </MudGrid>
</section>
